{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 81743, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 56834, "uid": 93889, "type": 4, "title": "皮肤塔攻略", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1625061893, "updated_at": 1660914047, "updated_uid": 87565, "comment_at": 1688017185, "last_at": 1688017185, "comment_count": 73, "status": 1, "summary": "皮肤塔介绍1、如1和2图所示，皮肤塔分五个级别，难度依次递增，每个级别又分为基础123阶段每颗星星增加难度递增。2、如图3完成每日皮肤塔每日任务可以获取一些皮肤币钻石金币，皮肤币可以抽皮肤天子等一些材", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625055716497_92552164.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 59, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 106774, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 59, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 81743, "content": "<span style=\"\"><div style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><div class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">皮肤塔介绍</span></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、如1和2图所示，皮肤塔分五个级别，难度依次递增，每个级别又分为基础123阶段每颗星星增加难度递增。</span><br></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625055716497_92552164.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625055716497_92552164.png\" style=\"\" data-width=\"820\" data-height=\"924\"></div></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div style=\"\"></div><div style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、如图3完成每日皮肤塔每日任务可以获取一些皮肤币钻石金币，皮肤币可以抽皮肤天子等一些材料。<span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">图3结合图2分析鲨鱼佬的小号可能是翻车了一个任务没完成</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">狗头</span></span></div><div style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、我们都知道难度越高奖励的皮肤币也就越多，最高级别是L5的三阶段也是就5-3，今天就让我们就来攻克5-3。</div></span><div style=\"\"></div><div style=\"\"></div><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"\" contenteditable=\"false\"><div class=\"title-p\" style=\"\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\">皮肤塔5-3攻略</span></span></div></div><br style=\"\"><div style=\"\"></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">首先我们来看一下5-3的敌方阵容</span></div><div style=\"\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1614862190241_41970106.png\" alt=\"皮肤塔文字版\" style=\"\" data-width=\"534\" data-height=\"113\"></div><div style=\"\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div style=\"\">&nbsp; </div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、非常弟弟的阵容，我们只需要处理2号位置的弗雷以及5号位置的反伤盾即可，其他三个位置纯属白给。</div><div style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、2号位置的弗雷高伤害SS或者大招都可能要了我们的命，所以需要有一个稳定控制弗雷的角色。</div><div style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 下图中5位天子均为束缚型天子SS技能都具有针对高攻击的两人加以高概率控制，都可以把弗雷控的死死的，所以5个任选其一作为控制（还有几个控制也可以这里不一一介绍了）。</div></span><div style=\"\"></div></span><div style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625058969725_63406953.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625058969725_63406953.png\" style=\"\" data-width=\"700\" data-height=\"148\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 甜甜圈&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 光魔方&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 暗丽莎&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 凯特西&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 圣诞老人</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、5号位置的哈迪斯具备反伤盾，因此我们需要一个能越塔强杀的刀，即带远程射击技能的刀卡。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 由于带远射技能的刀卡茫茫多，因此我只推荐其中5位，任选其一即可，当然其他的远射刀也可以，例如巴基什么的。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"></div></div></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625059995419_42078783.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625059995419_42078783.png\" style=\"\" data-width=\"700\" data-height=\"148\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 偶像马斯 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 独角兽 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 库西&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 机械丽莎 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 火石娘</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4、剩下三个位置我们选择木丽莎嫦娥复活奶即可（真正的萌新三巨头），<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">别问我拿什么替代木丽莎我也不知道哈哈。</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;格里拉你值得拥有。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625060375915_3695062.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625060375915_3695062.png\" style=\"\" data-width=\"424\" data-height=\"148\"><img data-v-34546da4=\"\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1640535951764_62666106.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1640535951764_62666106.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 150px; height: 150px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"></div></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">技能设置：刀卡设置NS</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 束缚设置S</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 木丽莎S</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;格里拉S</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 嫦娥SNN</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 复活奶S</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 队长BUFF选择木丽莎，用格里拉队长给嫦娥。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;这套阵容我认为是最好凑齐的了，首先复活奶和嫦娥都是白给的。控制和刀卡范围又很广，剩下就是木丽莎了。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">过关期望练度值：刀卡+4以上点火4个红星以上</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 束缚+3以上</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 木丽莎+0以上推荐点满火<br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;格里拉（你就大力培养不亏！）</div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 嫦娥+2以上<br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 复活奶+1以上推荐点火5个红星</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;装备肯定是全套5A+15，附魔属性稍微洗一洗ABC凑合就够用，魂卡的话选择适合角色的就行。<br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;如果你不具备这个练度，建议你先尝试打5-1，等你练度上来了再尝试5-3。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;注意此攻略是面向新手的，如果你说你各种U各种点满火，进来跟我说这个阵容牛B那个阵容吊，我一律不买账，这个阵容推荐不是给你看的<br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;如果有什么其他问题欢迎留言提问。</div></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 8, 8);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">补充一句如果你能过5-3，那用5-3的阵容去打最高难度地铁就像喝水一样简单</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"divider-line divider-line2\" contenteditable=\"false\"></div><br></div></div><div style=\"\"></div></span>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625055716497_92552164.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 93889, "username": "鲨鱼布丁", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/7.png", "description": "果然人生中重要的事情，不仅仅只有一件啊", "follow_num": 236, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "结丹中期 ", "tag_color": "#B138CE"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 6748984, "content_num": 24, "read_num": 1020372, "like_num": 852}, "update_user": {"uid": 87565, "username": "纠结37", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/11.png", "description": "DC混了一年半，好好玩半年，又要开始混了。", "follow_num": 141, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 5, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1069, "name": "天命之子韩服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603255687217_81752678.webp?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "destinychild", "content_count": 6962, "follow_count": 16729}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": [{"uid": 87565, "username": "纠结37", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/11.png", "last_ip_area": "吉林省", "last_login_device_num": 1}], "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/332900.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 4, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/652839.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 3, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/36968.p